IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `jllp-rules`

-- Judges (Long Leave Payments) Act 1979 (Cth) — the encoder's tests.

§ `Tests`

`fc` MEANS `a Judge of a federal court other than the High Court or the Federal Circuit and Family Court (Division 2)`

GIVEN h IS A `Ceasing`, s IS A NUMBER, q IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A `Judge case`
`a judge who` h `after` s `years with` q `qualifying` MEANS
    `Judge case` OF `fc`, h, FALSE, s, q, 520000, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE

-- s 4(1)-(2): 12 years, cap of 52 weeks.
#ASSERT `the weeks payable for` (`a judge who` `I resign or my term ends` `after` 12 `years with` 12 `qualifying`) EQUALS 52
#ASSERT `the amount payable for` (`a judge who` `I resign or my term ends` `after` 12 `years with` 12 `qualifying`) EQUALS 520000
-- 10 years' service but 7.9 years qualifying: 7 completed years, 36.4 weeks.
#ASSERT `the weeks payable for` (`a judge who` `I resign or my term ends` `after` 10 `years with` 7.9 `qualifying`) EQUALS 36.4
#ASSERT `the amount payable for` (`a judge who` `I resign or my term ends` `after` 10 `years with` 7.9 `qualifying`) EQUALS 364000
-- Under 10 years, resigning: nothing.
#ASSERT `the weeks payable for` (`a judge who` `I resign or my term ends` `after` 9.99 `years with` 9.99 `qualifying`) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the recipient for` (`a judge who` `I resign or my term ends` `after` 9.99 `years with` 9.99 `qualifying`) EQUALS `no one`
-- Death after 3 years: 15.6 weeks.
#ASSERT `the weeks payable for` (`a judge who` `I die` `after` 3 `years with` 3 `qualifying`) EQUALS 15.6
#ASSERT `the recipient for` (`a judge who` `I die` `after` 3 `years with` 3 `qualifying`) EQUALS `my legal personal representative`
#ASSERT `the recipient for` (`Judge case` OF `fc`, `I die`, FALSE, 3, 3, 520000, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE, TRUE) EQUALS `my surviving spouse or de facto partner`
#ASSERT `the recipient for` (`Judge case` OF `fc`, `I die`, FALSE, 3, 3, 520000, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, TRUE) EQUALS `my dependants`
-- s 4(2A): compulsory age after 8 years: no cap needed, 41.6 weeks; after 5 years: nothing.
#ASSERT `the weeks payable for` (`a judge who` `I reach the age at which I must cease to hold office` `after` 8 `years with` 8 `qualifying`) EQUALS 41.6
#ASSERT `the weeks payable for` (`a judge who` `I reach the age at which I must cease to hold office` `after` 5 `years with` 5 `qualifying`) EQUALS 0
-- s 4(2B): certified disability after 4 years.
#ASSERT `the weeks payable for` (`Judge case` OF `fc`, `I resign or my term ends`, FALSE, 4, 4, 520000, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS 20.8
#ASSERT `the recipient for` (`Judge case` OF `fc`, `I resign or my term ends`, FALSE, 4, 4, 520000, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS `me`
-- s 3A: immediate reappointment.
#ASSERT `the weeks payable for` (`Judge case` OF `fc`, `I resign or my term ends`, TRUE, 12, 12, 520000, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS 0
-- s 7: removal, with and without a direction.
#ASSERT `the weeks payable for` (`a judge who` `I am removed under section 72 of the Constitution or a like provision` `after` 12 `years with` 12 `qualifying`) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT `the weeks payable for` (`Judge case` OF `fc`, `I am removed under section 72 of the Constitution or a like provision`, FALSE, 12, 12, 520000, FALSE, TRUE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS 52
-- s 3: the High Court is outside.
#ASSERT `the weeks payable for` (`Judge case` OF `a Justice of the High Court`, `I resign or my term ends`, FALSE, 12, 12, 520000, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE, FALSE) EQUALS 0
#ASSERT (`the long leave position for` (`a judge who` `I die` `after` 3 `years with` 3 `qualifying`))'s `the amount payable` EQUALS 156000
